<title>JAPAN: TSE SAYS SEEKS TO LIST EXEDY CORP.</title>
<headline>TSE SAYS SEEKS TO LIST EXEDY CORP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Exedy Corp.</p>
<p>The company is likely to be listed on the first section of the TSE on August 20, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Exedy, which is now traded on the Osaka Securities Exchange, makes clutches for automobiles.</p>
</text>
